 396: *Proof.* The chosen actual pair services and has `TEMPO=M(P)<=2`, so its
 397: handoff is unripe by R4.1. Its `R_1<=2` bound says that every legal Attacker
 398: response returns an epoch with `M<=2`. Repeat with the same deterministic
 399: policy. Every reached epoch is serviced, and A2 gives perpetual survival. âˆŽ
