 540: The resulting ordered pair services the empty current imminent family and
 541: kills every old count-three label. Defender placements create no new alive
 542: label and change no Attacker count. Thus every surviving member of `L_23` at
 543: the actual handoff has count exactly two. L10.4 gives `TEMPO<=2` for this same
 544: actual pair, and definition (21) gives `M(P)<=2`. âˆŽ
