+
+`b_4=((10,0),(11,-1))`
+
+creates exactly the three count-four `s=10` starts `8,9,10`, with residuals
+
+`{8,9}`, `{9,14}`, `{14,15}`.
+
+Their only unordered services are `{8,14}`, `{9,14}`, and `{9,15}`, with both
