+### 7. MINOR — L15.9 counts eight live split-arm bridges, but only six survive the seals
+
+**Quoted claims:**
+
+> “The response pair creates a bridge exactly in these eight occupancies ...
+> `k=1,2,3,4`.” (L15.9)
