+# R-G7-REV — Round-9 hostile review
+
+**Reviewed branch / artifact:** `hunt/gap-raw`,
+`9e57ea060462788841d1f8f761db894981b482e9`
+
+**Reviewed document:** `GAP_RAW_PROOF_ROUND9.md`
+
